rx65n/envision_hw.c
rx65n/envision_hw.h
------------------------------------------------------------------------

These two files are derived from EnvisionDemo1 in

    https://github.com/miniwinwm/RenesasEnvisionGCC

    MIT License
    Copyright (c) 2019 John Blaiklock

and are distributed under that MIT licence, whose full text is reproduced
at the top of each of them. They hold the board-specific register
sequences for the RX65N Envision Kit - the system clock, the GLCDC, and
the touch controller's I2C - which are values only meaningful for that
board and not worth re-deriving.

Nothing else in this repository is derived from that project. In
particular rx65n/lcdtp.c and rx65n/lcdtp.h contain no code from it: they
reach the hardware only through the handful of functions declared in
rx65n/envision_hw.h.

Building the RX65N port also requires the startup files (vectors, reset
code, linker script, and Renesas' generated iodefine.h) from the same
upstream project. Those are fetched at build time and are deliberately
not redistributed here - see rx65n/README.md.
